kronaxis-router
================

Third-party design attribution
------------------------------

The content-aware prompt compression in this project
(compress.go, compress_json.go, compress_code.go) is a clean-room Go
reimplementation of ideas described by the Headroom project:

    Headroom — https://github.com/chopratejas/headroom
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically, the following concepts were used as inspiration:

  - ContentRouter: detect the content type of each segment and dispatch
    to a type-specific compressor (compress.go).
  - SmartCrusher: structural compaction of JSON / structured data
    (compress_json.go).
  - CodeCompressor: dropping comments and comment-only lines from code
    (compress_code.go).

No Headroom source code was copied. The implementations here are
original Go, written against the published descriptions of the above
concepts, and differ in approach (e.g. the code compressor is a
string-literal-aware lexical scanner restricted to languages where
comment stripping is provably safe, rather than a full AST parser).

This attribution is provided as a courtesy and in the spirit of the
Apache 2.0 NOTICE convention; because no Apache-licensed source is
redistributed here, no Apache 2.0 obligations attach to this file.
